[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/418856259","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/33434#issuecomment-418856259","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/33434","id":418856259,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQxODg1NjI1OQ==","user":{"login":"fredgalvao","id":616464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNjQ2NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/616464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao","html_url":"https://github.com/fredgalvao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-09-05T19:40:43Z","updated_at":"2018-09-05T19:40:43Z","body":"The following patch, inspired by the [groovy join implementation](https://github.com/groovy/groovy-core/blob/01309f9d4be34ddf93c4a9943b5a97843bff6181/src/main/org/codehaus/groovy/runtime/DefaultGroovyMethods.java#L5960-L5975), fixes the issue.\r\n\r\n```patch\r\n      */\r\n     public static <T> String join(Iterable<T> receiver, String separator) {\r\n         StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();\r\n+        boolean first = true;\r\n         for (T t : receiver) {\r\n-            if (sb.length() > 0) {\r\n+            if (first) {\r\n+                first = false\r\n+            } else {\r\n                 sb.append(separator);\r\n             }\r\n             sb.append(t);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis other patch will add a simple test for it on `AugmentationTests.java`:\r\n```patch\r\n     public void testIterable_Join() {\r\n         assertEquals(\"test,ing\",\r\n                 exec(\"List l = new ArrayList(); l.add('test'); l.add('ing'); l.join(',')\"));\r\n+        assertEquals(\";0;;1;null;3;\",\r\n+                exec(\"List l = Arrays.asList(\\\"\\\", \\\"0\\\", \\\"\\\", \\\"1\\\", null, \\\"3\\\", \\\"\\\"); l.join(';')\"));\r\n     }\r\n \r\n     public void testIterable_Sum() {\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/418856259/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"fredgalvao","id":616464,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNjQ2NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/616464?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao","html_url":"https://github.com/fredgalvao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fredgalvao/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/418949153","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/33434#issuecomment-4